# Stage 7f's criterion (TASK-24, docs/research/desktop/plan.md, ADR-0169):
# the settings window changes the theme and the active layout, and the
# frames and the keys follow at once, without a restart; edit saves a Czech
# file that the file manager then lists. Coordinates are logical at scale 1
# (1024 x 768): the dock's tiles at y 722, term 377, files 427, edit 477,
# settings 527; each new window 32 further right and down from the first
# terminal's frame at (72, 70). bg.frame.focused is f7f7f8 light, 2f3136
# dark.
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
# The settings window from the dock, focused by its title bar.
click 527 722
pause 1500
click 250 115
region 200 106 60 4 f7f7f8
shot settings
# Dark: written, applied, and the focused frame turns dark.
click 185 235
serial settings: Saved and applied.
region 200 106 60 4 2f3136
shot dark
# Czech on, then in use (the second of the enabled layouts).
click 413 471
serial settings: Saved and applied.
click 342 535
serial settings: Saved and applied.
shot czech
# The terminal, focused: on the Czech layout (QWERTZ) the keys of z and y
# type y and z.
click 400 80
region 130 76 100 4 2f3136
origin 73 106
type echo zy\r
screen yz
screen ~> _
# edit from the dock, focused; Czech text typed on the Czech layout.
click 477 722
pause 1500
click 400 151
region 200 140 60 4 2f3136
click 400 300
layout cz
type Příliš žluťoučký kůň\r
layout us
shot edit
# Save as: the chooser's sheet, the suggested name replaced by a Czech one.
click 357 203
pause 1000
key tab
key end
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
key backspace
layout cz
type poznámky.txt
layout us
shot save-sheet
type \r
serial edit: saved poznámky.txt
# The file manager lists it.
click 427 722
serial files: ~ lists poznámky.txt
shot files-lists
# The first terminal turns the machine off.
click 400 80
# Half a second after the focusing click: keys typed at once can be lost
# (docs/backlog.md).
pause 500
origin 73 106
type poweroff\r
exit
